{"ID":"20240206111747-i2jwyqm","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206111747-i2jwyqm","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111747-i2jwyqm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111759-e6o87tu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111755-y7jbfsz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111759-e6o87tu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:231,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:231\u0026#125;","title":"乌梢蛇","type":"doc","updated":"20240709111953"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206111759-e6o87tu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111759-e6o87tu","updated":"20240206111803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于山东、江西、浙江等地。\n【性状】\t该品呈圆盘状，盘径约16cm。表面黑褐色或绿黑色，密被菱形鳞片；背鳞行数成双，背中央2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4行鳞片强烈起棱，形成两条纵贯全体的黑线。头盘在中间，扁圆形，眼大而下凹陷，有光泽。上唇鳞8枚，第4、5枚入眶，颊鳞1枚，眼前下鳞1枚，较小，眼后鳞2枚。脊部高耸成屋脊状，俗称剑脊。腹部剖开边缘向内卷曲，脊肌肉厚，黄白色或淡棕色，可见排列整齐的肋骨。尾部渐细而长。尾下鳞双行。剥皮者仅留头尾之皮鳞，中段较光滑。气腥，味淡。\n【性味】\t甘，平。\n【功效】\t祛风，通络，止痉。用于风湿顽痹，麻木拘挛，中风口眼歪斜，半身不遂，抽搐痉挛，破伤风，麻风疥癣，瘰疬恶疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240206111755-y7jbfsz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111755-y7jbfsz","updated":"20240206111755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206111755-eco064a.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709112023-3yjyeue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709112023-3yjyeue","updated":"20240709112023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 650px;","style":"width: 640px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌梢蛇2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌梢蛇2-20240709112023-0naz6jr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 640px;\" parent-style=\"width: 650px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709111953-ifdczss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709111953-ifdczss","updated":"20240709111953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 550px;","style":"width: 540px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌梢蛇1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌梢蛇1-20240709111953-fiumffb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 540px;\" parent-style=\"width: 550px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 678px;","style":"width: 668px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌梢蛇-20240703111824-cbe143g"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌梢蛇-20240703111824-cbe143g.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 668px;\" parent-style=\"width: 678px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709111642-l9vcq8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709111642-l9vcq8r","updated":"20240830103840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 653px;","style":"width: 643px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌梢蛇3-20240703111827-gqkf7za"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌梢蛇3-20240703111827-gqkf7za.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 643px;\" parent-style=\"width: 653px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 582px;","style":"width: 572px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌梢蛇"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌梢蛇-20240830103840-r21kyap.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 572px;\" parent-style=\"width: 582px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709111644-11lbcxr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240709111644-11lbcxr"}},{"ID":"20240830103601-y1thwxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103601-y1thwxr","updated":"20240830103605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乌梢蛇"}]},{"ID":"20240830103601-ao7npy4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103601-ao7npy4","updated":"20240830103610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味：味甘，性平。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103601-bux2gwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103601-bux2gwa","updated":"20240830103610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经：入肺、脾、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103627-eqy255a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103627-eqy255a","updated":"20240830103628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功效：祛风湿，通经络，止痉。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103632-ag4352w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103632-ag4352w","updated":"20240830103633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治：风湿顽痹，肌肤麻木，筋脉拘挛，肢体瘫痪，破伤风，麻风，风疹疥癣。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103602-dibnbpn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830103602-dibnbpn","updated":"20240830103605"}},{"ID":"20240830103603-vpnahl3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103603-vpnahl3","updated":"20240830103605"}}